        <mxCell id="note" value="¹ Warehouse executes resolution with new documents before closure. ACK/closure never deduct again. Supplier-owned goods reduce custody only.&lt;br&gt;Owner/purchasing personnel may contact the supplier externally; Accountant records agreement/ACK. No purchasing or delivery application role is added." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f3f5f8;strokeColor=#d6dde6;align=left;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#34465e;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
